{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-06_beg","storyGroup":"main_15","storySort":218,"storyDependence":"main_15_level_main_15-06_beg","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"15-7","storyName":"临界时刻","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"博士和阿米娅完成了思维共享，并在黑王冠的协助下准备越过“文明的存续”的边界。阿米娅亲眼看到了博士曾经向她讲述的童话。卡特斯感染者见到了深空中的神秘精灵。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_main_15-06_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"main_15-06","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":6,"next":8,"characters":["阿米娅","魔王","自内心响起的声音","希尔达","屈光者","神秘的精灵"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_bg_bg_ceo.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士，我从未尝试过利用黑王冠来接触你的思维——","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":13},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"15","text":"不必紧张，阿米娅。"},"2":{"id":"15","text":"我已经完全向你敞开我的内心和思维。"}},"values":[],"id":14},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":15,"end":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"……好。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":18},{"type":"text","text":"她看向了自己的身侧，那一束温柔的白光正轻轻拉着她的手。","id":19},{"type":"text","text":"她闭上眼，长舒一口气。","id":20,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":21},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":22},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“我们一起，阿米娅。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":23},{"type":"subtitle","id":24},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士，我也不知道我们这趟旅程通往何处，但我会保护你。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":28},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“我也会保护你，阿米娅。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":30},{"type":"subtitle","id":31},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":32},{"type":"text","text":"她在“魔王”的注视下，轻轻触碰着你的额前——","id":33},{"type":"dialog","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#3$2","id":35},{"type":"bg","duration":"3","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"你的记忆和情感正向我流淌过来。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"……感觉很奇怪。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"明明它们的波动如此平静温和，明明记忆的尽头并不遥远……","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"当初特蕾西娅小姐到底看到了什么——","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":41},{"type":"text","text":"阿米娅看到你，看到了凯尔希，看到了自己，还有罗德岛上许许多多的人。","id":42},{"type":"text","text":"她越走越深，那个记忆的边界已经触手可及。“好奇”与“担忧”致使她几乎忘记了自己的目的，她想要触及那道边界……","id":43},{"type":"text","text":"想要触及你记忆的起点。切尔诺伯格，石棺，还有那个虚弱地伸出手的你——","id":44},{"type":"dialog","id":45},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":46},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":47},{"type":"charslot","id":48},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_0_1.png","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":49},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":50},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“博士……抓紧我的手！！”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":52},{"type":"subtitle","id":53},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":54},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"……","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"好像还有其他的记忆？为什么模糊不清？","id":57},{"type":"dialog","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":59},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0","fadetime":"1","id":60},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_signlntrfrnc","volume":"1","id":61},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_signalInterference","layer":"1","id":62},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":63},{"type":"cg","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"1","id":64},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_8_9.png","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_signalInterference","layer":"2","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":67},{"type":"cg","duration":"0","from":"1","to":"0","id":68},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_0_1.png","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":69},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"——？！","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"那是——","id":72},{"type":"dialog","id":73},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":74},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“阿米娅！”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":75},{"type":"subtitle","id":76},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"dialog","id":78},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"3","id":79},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":80},{"type":"image","id":81},{"type":"charslot","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#5$2","id":83},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":85},{"type":"text","text":"你的手抓住了阿米娅。","id":86},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":88},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"90","text":"……你迷失了？"}},"values":[],"id":89},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":90,"end":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#7$2","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"我，我不知道，这也是我第一次如此深入地接触他人的思维，这种感觉……很奇异。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-7$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":94},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"96","text":"但好在你成功了。"}},"values":[],"id":95},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":96,"end":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#8$2","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"是的，博士，我现在能感受到你每一丝细微的情绪。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":100},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"102","text":"我也能感受到你。"}},"values":[],"id":101},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":102,"end":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#11$2","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"欸，你现在很放松嘛！","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-11$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":106},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"108","text":"有阿米娅在，我并不需要担心什么。"}},"values":[],"id":107},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":108,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":110},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"112","text":"接下来，我们应该怎么做？"}},"values":[],"id":111},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":112,"end":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#8$2","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士，拉紧我的手。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"接下来的路，我会保护你走下去的。关于魔王的一切，特蕾西娅小姐在那一天已经全部教给了我。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"在那条路的前面，“她”已经在等着我们了。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":117,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":118},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":119},{"type":"charslot","id":120},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":123},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_desolate_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":124,"musicid":1},{"type":"subtitle","text":"……","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":125},{"type":"subtitle","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":127},{"type":"sticker","id":128,"multi":"true","text":"我理解你的理由，但我无法提供，你的请求违背了DWDB-221E的底层逻辑。","x":"250","y":"300","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"820","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":129,"multi":"true","text":"\\n但我可以提供绕过限制的方法，凯尔希——","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":130,"multi":"true","text":"\\n“深潜”。","alignment":"left","duration":"1","size":"24","delay":"0.04","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":131,"multi":"true","text":"\\n可惜连特蕾西娅也无法走到如此遥远的地方，其中的风险远远超过了她所能承受的范围——","size":"24","delay":"0.04","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":132,"multi":"true","text":"\\n你并不奢求从我这里获得答案？那为何你如此执着于求助我访问这些于你无益的数据？","size":"24","delay":"0.04","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":133},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_signlntrfrnc","volume":"1","id":134},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_signalInterference","layer":"1","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#1$1","duration":"2","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"“我无法确认是否终有一天，阿米娅会向你提出同样的问题。但我希望，她能在黑暗中找到我为她照亮的方向。”","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"凯尔希便是如此回答我，阿米娅。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"……请问您能为我们调出凯尔希医生的所有访问记录吗？","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#1$1","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"当然。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"她每一次的疑惑，每一次的坚持，还有每一次的失落离去，我将无一保留地展示给你们。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"阿米娅，你也曾深入过“文明的存续”，但这一次，你所寻找的东西远在边际之外。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"那是泰拉生命暂时无法踏足的领域，但或许你有机会访问那些不属于你们的知识。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"因为你的同行者——Dr.{@nickname}。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":150},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"152","text":"……我？"}},"values":[],"id":151},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":152,"end":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#1$1","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"你很快便会知晓我的意思，Dr.{@nickname}。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"随我来吧，阿米娅，来到——","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":157},{"type":"charslot","id":158},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_bg_60_g6_crownboundary.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.3","yScale":"1.3","x":"60","id":159},{"type":"backgroundtween","duration":"30","xTo":"-20","block":"false","id":160},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":162},{"type":"text","text":"“文明奇点”。","id":163},{"type":"text","text":"纯白巨型长廊环绕着中央那不可捉摸的点——“奇点”。","id":164},{"type":"text","text":"庞杂的信息流不断从奇点中溢出，能够被你们所捕获的信息皆是足以被你们理解的知识。","id":165},{"type":"text","text":"阿米娅看不到来时的路。但要是沿着长廊继续走下去，在浪费了难以估量的时间后，阿米娅终将回到原点。","id":166},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":168},{"type":"charslot","id":169},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_bg_60_g6_crownboundary.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":170},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":171},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":173},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"你发现了，阿米娅。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"文明发展的停滞并非意味着原地踏步，时间依旧会在线性的轨迹上不可逆转地向前推进。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"但生命所创造的和所发现的一切却只会陷入无法脱离的循环。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"数学、物理、哲学、神学等各种理论和实践都无法再创造希望。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"向上的螺旋已经失效，生命将在迷失方向的道路上空耗他们的未来。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"所以……这里就已经是边界？","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#1$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"只是泰拉目前所能触碰的知识边界。它既是限制，也是保护。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"保护？","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":187},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"189","text":"某种思维认知的保护……"}},"values":[],"id":188},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":189,"end":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#7$2","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"思维认知？","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-7$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":192},{"type":"charslot","id":193},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"195","text":"就像我们没法强迫小沙地兽计算洋流的规律？"}},"values":[],"id":194},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":195,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":196},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"198","text":"哪怕我们能给出所有的数据和公式……"}},"values":[],"id":197},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":198,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":200},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"202","text":"硬来依旧会伤害它们的小脑瓜。"}},"values":[],"id":201},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":202,"end":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#1$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"你的直觉很敏锐，博士，但并非完全准确。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#7$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"DWDB-221E会启迪生命稳步走向未来，而非简单将未来的碎片展现于求索者的眼前，导致违背自然规律与伦理的演化飞跃。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"阿米娅，知识是不可逆转的。瞥见过真实天空的理想家将不再甘愿蒙昧地安眠于大地。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"而超越文明本身思维认知极限的信息，只会变成诱惑他们忽视现实，走向毁灭陷阱的毒药，继而将他们的文明带入深渊。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"于是，边界诞生了。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"可为什么边界的构成……像是某种庞大的数据服务器组成的监牢？","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#7$1","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"它以你所能接受的形态出现，一如DWDB-221E在物质界以一顶黑色冠冕的形态陪伴着你。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"对渺小的蝼蚁而言，边界可以是一条首尾相连的湍急河流，永远无法汇入大海。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"而对寿命以万亿年计量的天体而言，边界亦可以是伴随其一生的引力场，不可捉摸，不可逃脱。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":217},{"type":"text","text":"你走向了与虚空一步之遥的断面，遥远中心处的“奇点”在吸引着你。","id":218},{"type":"text","text":"信息如波浪般轻轻地从你身旁掠过，却足以让你一瞥许多新奇的场景。","id":219},{"type":"text","text":"那是属于你过去的浮光掠影——你失去后又遗忘的生活。","id":220},{"type":"text","text":"一个“陌生时代”的幻影。","id":221,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":223},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"225","text":"……"}},"values":[],"id":224},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":225,"end":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士，小心！","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":228},{"type":"text","text":"阿米娅紧张地拉住了你的手。","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"我们没法确认从边界坠下会发生什么——","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#5$2","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"这些是……你看到的……？","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-5$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":235},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"237","text":"……你我思维相通……"},"2":{"id":"237","text":"……你能看到我所看到的……"}},"values":[],"id":236},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":237,"end":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#5$2","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"——“源石虫的卵鞘”“穿过星星之间的独木桥”——","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#9$2","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"……所有那些故事都是真实存在的。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8d/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-9$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":243},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"245","text":"“源石虫的卵鞘”？"},"2":{"id":"245","text":"“穿过星星之间的独木桥”？"}},"values":[],"id":244},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":245,"end":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"……","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#8$2","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"在很小很小的时候，我遇到了一个很在意的人。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"那个人明明自己也脆弱得不行，却一定要固执地背着我跨过满是源石碎屑的小径。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"在我发烧昏昏沉沉，但又害怕噩梦不敢睡觉的时候，那个人也会不厌其烦地给我讲那些我从未听过的故事。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"在逼仄黑暗的矿洞里，那个人也会毫不犹豫地砸碎自己好不容易找到的矿石样本——","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"然后把那些发光的小石头嵌在四周的岩壁上，为我讲述星星，还有坐落在云天之上的乐园的故事。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":254},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":255},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"257","text":"……"}},"values":[],"id":256},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":257,"end":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#8$2","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士，愿意听听那个人讲给我的故事吗？","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":261},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"263","text":"……"},"2":{"id":"263","text":"当然。"}},"values":[],"id":262},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":263,"end":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"有一个人，总是独自驾驶着像是源石虫卵鞘的神奇载具穿过星星之间的独木桥。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"在最为幽静的夜晚，也有引路人从上了年纪的星星那里借来发光的云朵，造出圆圆的镜子照亮前路。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"而在独木桥的另一头，尖塔在大气潮汐中若隐若现，还有戴在星星额头上的花环。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"当降落在花环上时，会发现那里是一座很大很大的游乐场，而可爱的好孩子们会聚集在那里肆意玩耍。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"但驾驶载具的人却很难停下……","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"那人会换到一艘最神奇的载具里，驾驶着它驶过漫长的岁月……","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"而岁月的尽头，却空无一人。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#2$2","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"只剩自己。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-2$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":274},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":275},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"277","text":"那是……我？"},"2":{"id":"277","text":"为你讲故事的人……是我？"}},"values":[],"id":276},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":277,"end":287},{"type":"text","text":"阿米娅紧紧地握住了你的手。","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"是的。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"由于感染的缘故，那时我很难记住很多的东西，我也无法理解故事里的很多东西。","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"但我会努力去想，尽全力去记住你讲过的每一个故事。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"因为那是属于我的故事，是你送给我的故事。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"……我不想忘记。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#8$2","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士，没想到今天我终于可以把这些你送我的礼物再分享给你。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"这一次，我们已经共同亲眼见证。于我，于你，都重新认识了那段逝去的生活。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":289},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"291","text":"谢谢你，阿米娅……"}},"values":[],"id":290},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":291,"end":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#8$2","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士，你会向往那样的生活吗？","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":295},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"297","text":"向往。"},"2":"不向往。"},"values":["2"],"id":296},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":297,"end":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#8$2","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"也难怪呀。和博士一样，第一次想到那些奇妙的生活时，我也向往过。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"那样的生活是我无论如何也没法真正触碰的。","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"我会忍不住偷偷和特蕾西娅小姐分享，我们俩会用许多奇怪的想象增添更多的细节——","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"直到它变得面目全非，变得越来越遥不可及……","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"而现在亲眼瞥见一点点之后，我反而觉得自己和你过去的生活不再那么遥远了。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"Dr.{@nickname}，你相信我们的这片大地终有一天也会如那样美好吗？","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":306},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"308","text":{"id":"308","text":{"id":"308","text":"也许会更好……"}}}},"values":[],"id":307},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","1","1"],"id":308,"end":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#8$2","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"是啊，我们会见到。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"罗德岛会见到的。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png","end":true},{"type":"useless","references":["2"],"id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#7$2","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"并不向往？奇怪，那样的生活的确很美好不是吗？","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"没有矿石病的痛苦，没有纷争与战乱，孩子们能尽情地享受快乐……","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":318},{"type":"decision","options":{"2":{"id":"320","text":{"id":"320","text":"我始终坚信生活的背面永远存在，阿米娅。"}}},"values":[],"id":319},{"type":"predicate","references":["2","2"],"id":320,"end":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#3$2","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"也许吧。快乐背后的残酷，痛苦背后的喜悦，我们的确都已体验过。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"不过，我也偷偷向特蕾西娅小姐分享过那些奇妙的故事，她同样为此惊讶。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"她一直渴望着卡兹戴尔……不，是渴望着这片大地的每个人都有机会体验那样的生活。也因此她不断努力着。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#8$2","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"我们可不能落后呀，博士。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"也许终有一天，罗德岛也能在这片大地上见证那样的生活。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-8$2.png","end":true},{"type":"useless","references":["1","2"],"id":329},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"charslot","id":331},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"333","text":"……"}},"values":[],"id":332},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":333,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":334},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"336","text":"我们接下来该怎么做？"}},"values":[],"id":335},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":336,"end":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#1$1","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"“深潜”。","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"DWDB-221E所储存的完整数据会经由奇点解码并输出合理且合适的信息。","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"仅靠阿米娅无法突破其底层逻辑的限制。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":342},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"344","text":"……我是特例？"}},"values":[],"id":343},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":344,"end":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#1$1","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"尚未可知，但的确存在这样的可能性。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"可那些信息，我们如何接近呢？","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#10$1","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"抱歉，阿米娅，对此我并无更加有效的资料。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"但我能够不断检索凯尔希所留下的线索，让可能对你们有用的信息在排序上更容易被找到。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-10$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":352},{"type":"charslot","id":353},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"355","text":"也许能搭建一座桥？"}},"values":[],"id":354},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":355,"end":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"桥？","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":359},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"361","text":"通向奇点的桥。"},"2":{"id":"361","text":"通向知识的桥。"},"3":{"id":"361","text":"凯尔希不是已经为我们指引了前路吗？"}},"values":[],"id":360},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2","3"],"id":361,"end":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"曾有人这么做过吗？","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#7$1","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"记录中并无先例。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"……无论如何，值得一试。","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#10$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"这其中的风险你们必须知晓，越靠近奇点，信息的密度会越高，你们甚至极有可能体验到信息的质量。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#5$2","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"信息存在质量？","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#10$1","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"在这里，它存在。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"且未完全筛选的信息有概率如洪流般摧毁你们的思维。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1#3$1","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"魔王","text":"而思维湮灭意味着……","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_4134_cetsyr_1-3$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":378},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"380","text":"死亡。"}},"values":[],"id":379},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":380,"end":381},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":381,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":382},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":383},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":384},{"type":"charslot","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#1$1","id":386},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_60_g2_rhodeslivingroom_bc.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":387},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":388},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":389},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":390,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"自内心响起的声音","text":"（未知语言）旅者，我只是在目睹又一次毁灭的发生罢了。","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"自内心响起的声音","text":"（未知语言）希尔达，这是你的名字吧？","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#1$1","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"你在叫我的名字？","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"我无法理解你的语言。而且，你是怎么知道——","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":397},{"type":"text","text":"卡特斯透过舷窗看到那个深空中的身影慢慢向自己所在的舰船靠近，继而消失在了视野之外。","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#1$1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"屈光者，请问那是谁？","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1725_1#1$1","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"jump","posto":"0,0","power":"50","times":"1","duration":"0.8","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"屈光者","text":"（激烈的歌声）♪——♪——♪——","id":405},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#9$1","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"——您怎么了？！","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1725_1#1$1","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"屈光者","text":"我们很少有人喜欢她！","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_1725_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"屈光者","text":"抱歉，旅者，我实在无法容忍自己与她共处一室。","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_1725_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"屈光者","text":"我的其他朋友要是看到了，也会因为这个唾弃我。","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_1725_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1","id":413},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":414},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":415},{"type":"charslot","id":416},{"type":"text","text":"当困惑的卡特斯回过神来时，整间舱室中除了她已经空无一人。在预感到某个不受欢迎的人到来之前，所有人都已经提前离开了。","id":417},{"type":"dialog","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1720_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":419},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":420},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cosmicelfvoice","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":423},{"type":"text","text":"然后卡特斯看到了。","id":424},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1720_1#2$1","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的精灵","text":"不必惊讶，我学习过通过远距离共振进行交流的技巧。","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_1720_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的精灵","text":"至少，在毁灭那个奇特的种族之前，我保留下了他们进化出的独特语言模式。","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_1720_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#1$1","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"……毁、毁灭？","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1720_1#1$1","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的精灵","text":"（叹气）","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1720_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的精灵","text":"新来的客人，你也对毁灭的行为不齿？","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1720_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#4$1","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"我……并不清楚发生了什么。","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1720_1#1$1","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的精灵","text":"并不复杂，我们的族群曾经以噬星为生。其他人所厌恶的，无非是我们赖以生存的本能而已。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1720_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的精灵","text":"不过，如今我们的过往都只是流传于旁人口中的恐怖奇谈罢了。","id":437,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1720_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的精灵","text":"我的族群几近灭绝，恐怕我已经是最后一人。","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1720_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的精灵","text":"呵，我们以毁灭为生，最终当真正的毁灭降临于我们的面前时，我们却无能为力……","id":439,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1720_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的精灵","text":"自那以后，作为苟活者，我已经在几位天才的帮助下改变了摄入生存必要能量的方式——","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1720_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#1$1","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"听上去……您也正试着融入另一种生活。","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"所以刚刚您在深空中注视着那颗死去的星球，也是在缅怀您所经历的毁灭？","id":443,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1720_1#1$1","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的精灵","text":"缅怀？","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1720_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的精灵","text":"哈哈，并非如此。","id":446,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1720_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1720_1#3$1","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的精灵","text":"这里的每个人都坦然且乐观地接受毁灭追上我们。","id":448,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_npc_1720_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1719_1#10$1","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"希尔达","text":"——？！","id":450,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1719_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":451},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":452},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":453},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":454},{"type":"image","id":455},{"type":"charslot","id":456}],"characters":["阿米娅","魔王","自内心响起的声音","希尔达","屈光者","神秘的精灵"]}